{"unit_id": "Amengclass__dsh-settings-hub#card-zh", "repo": "Amengclass/dsh-settings-hub", "commit": "72910cca0f425f2de7cfd00d2d4423b8678bafd6", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "DSH Settings Hub 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的设置界面插件：它接管侧边栏设置入口，把第三方插件提供的设置页集中到可折叠的“扩展设置项”分组中。界面保留通用设置、模型、插件和 Agent 预设等原生导航项，并按插件归类其他设置页；用户可以拖动调整插件组及组内页面顺序，排序保存在浏览器本地。插件还读取已安装插件依赖关系，辅助识别设置页所属插件。适合希望在一个位置浏览和整理 DSH 插件设置的用户。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:404-451", "lib/client.js:738-779", "index.js:90-109"]}
{"unit_id": "Amengclass__dsh-settings-hub#card-en", "repo": "Amengclass/dsh-settings-hub", "commit": "72910cca0f425f2de7cfd00d2d4423b8678bafd6", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "DSH Settings Hub groups third-party DSH settings pages under a collapsible sidebar section, while keeping native sections visible. Users can drag plugin groups and pages to reorder them; the order is saved in browser local storage. It reads plugin dependencies to help identify each page’s owner.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:404-451", "lib/client.js:738-779", "index.js:90-109"]}
{"unit_id": "Amengclass__dsh-settings-hub#feature-group-settings", "repo": "Amengclass/dsh-settings-hub", "commit": "72910cca0f425f2de7cfd00d2d4423b8678bafd6", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "DSH Settings Hub 的功能「按插件归类设置页」：设置面板把第三方插件的设置页集中显示在可折叠的扩展设置组中，并保留原生设置导航。打开侧边栏设置入口即可浏览对应分组和页面。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:898-946", "lib/client.js:1013-1039"]}
{"unit_id": "Amengclass__dsh-settings-hub#feature-reorder-settings", "repo": "Amengclass/dsh-settings-hub", "commit": "72910cca0f425f2de7cfd00d2d4423b8678bafd6", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "DSH Settings Hub 的功能「拖动排序」：用户可在设置面板中拖动插件分组或同一插件下的设置页调整顺序；新的顺序保存到浏览器本地存储，之后仍可使用。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:301-316", "lib/client.js:738-779"]}
